tbc-lib-go
==========

Portions of this software were derived from github.com/libsv/go-bk
(commit history is preserved by file-level copyright headers) and are
redistributed under the terms of the original ISC license.

The vendored sources live under the following directories of this module:

  base58/   — derived from libsv/go-bk/base58
  bec/      — derived from libsv/go-bk/bec
  bip32/    — derived from libsv/go-bk/bip32
  chaincfg/ — derived from libsv/go-bk/chaincfg
  crypto/   — Sha256/Sha256d/Ripemd160/Hash160 hash primitives and the
              EncryptSingle/DecryptSingle helpers were derived from
              libsv/go-bk/crypto
  wif/      — derived from libsv/go-bk/wif

